      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--body)">At the start of 2025, about one merged pull request in thirty was too large to review in half an hour. By mid-2026 it was one in ten. Most of that code is shipping without a full read, through tools that still paint every relocated line as a deletion.</p>
